{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>They rise up</b> — He explains why HaShem brings the evil upon them and disaster comes upon them that they did not know, in exchange for 'which I did not know.'" "<b>And the meaning of they ask me</b> — they ask me to give them what I did not know, only with violent testimony."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:36.618414918Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}